Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(site): keyboard shortcut and mouse reference

New guide page listing every keyboard shortcut and mouse gesture bound
in crates/ui, with Windows/Linux and macOS columns (egui's command
modifier is Cmd on macOS; pick add-to-selection uses the real Control
key on all platforms, noted against PR #1242). Unbound items the
issue asked about are listed under "Not bound yet". Linked from
first-run.

Fixes #1246

